# boot: the UEFI loader and what draws the boot on a screen. Debian's grub-efi.
#
# Milestone 611 (every program and crate belongs to a package). The package's name, kind, home
# and membership are provisional, the lane's proposal for calef to ratify; the format is
# helpers/packages.py's header, and notes/package-boundaries.md has the table and the reasons.

name boot
kind base
home boot provisional

interface screen_console
interface bitmap_font
interface sealed_pair

crate uefi_loader
crate board_console

exception 2026-09-27 board_console job_mix the board console runs the job mix to prove a board boots; the mix is a fixture a release image should not carry
